# The Lago bug of RESULTS.md (finding 1): Redis is down while the customer cust4 cancels. Lago
# commits the termination of sub4 to PostgreSQL, then cannot enqueue the job that bills it, and
# answers 500; the client's retry gets 404 (the subscription is no longer active). No invoice for
# sub4 is ever made, and its November usage is never billed. The default composition (W seed 0)
# terminates sub4 in round 2; Redis is killed before round 1 and restarted before round 5.
# commands: anytime_redeliver eventually_1_billing_tick eventually_2_transfers_charged first_seed parallel_driver_batch parallel_driver_event serial_driver_terminate
# expect: violation
disk=none | run K=redis@1+4
